# Sphinx's Approach: "Draw two cards. Then you may exile this spell and four cards named Sphinx's Approach from your
# graveyard. If you do, search your library for a Sphinx creature card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle."
# Emry mills the four copies at the top of the library on turn one (CR 701.17a), then the Approach is cast for {1}{U}{U}
# with a Mox Sapphire and a Black Lotus. Accepting exiles the spell and exactly those four cards together (CR 701.13) and
# finds Sphinx of the Guildpact; the two cards drawn are Islands, so the Sphinx is still in the library for the search.

